      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create decrypt_payload.py in the current working directory.\nTask: decrypts a ciphertext payload with a managed key.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc5980a8001520vpG9BiEZ0LZ",
